  Title: Paesaggi sonori barocchi e strumentazione in "L'Orfeo"
  TitleKey: 
  SubTitle: 
  SubTitleKey: 
  Type: 1
  ProfilingData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6605cbf739e1913408cd5a9d221a7ec8, type: 2}
  Questions:
  - Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4371403dbb5b4ad46bb04d54f5d159cd, type: 3}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Come si confronta l'accordatura barocca (La=415 Hz) con quella moderna
        (La=440 Hz)?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 pi\xF9 bassa, offrendo un suono pi\xF9 caldo e risonante"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 pi\xF9 alta, creando un suono pi\xF9 lancinante"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 identica; \xE8 cambiata solo la forma degli strumenti"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Varia a seconda dell'umore del musicista
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: In cosa consiste la tecnica del "colore tonale" di Monteverdi nell'Orfeo?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Nel cambiare il volume in base alle luci del palco
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Nell'usare solo archi per l'intera opera
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Nell'assegnare gruppi strumentali specifici a regni diversi (Cielo/Inferi)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Nel dipingere le scenografie mentre si canta
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Quale strumento rappresenta il "suono dolce dei pastori" (il mondo dei
        vivi)?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Il Regale
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Organo di legno
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Trombone (Sackbut)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Tromba
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Perch\xE9 le corde di budello (gut strings) erano essenziali per il
        suono del violino barocco?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Erano pi\xF9 resistenti di quelle in metallo"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Perch\xE9 le corde di metallo non esistevano ancora"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Perch\xE9 erano pi\xF9 economiche da produrre"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Offrivano un suono pi\xF9 ricco, \"umano\" e complesso"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Qual era il ruolo del Cornetto nell'orchestra di Monteverdi?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Era un "mistero ibrido" che imitava la voce umana
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Era uno strumento a percussione
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Era usato solo per fanfare militari
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Sostituiva i flauti nelle scene pastorali
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Quale strumento Monteverdi defin\xEC \"ringhiante\" (snarling), assegnandolo
        agli Inferi?"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Arpa Doppia
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Il Regale
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Violino Barocco
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Tiorba
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Cosa caratterizza la "Dinamica a Terrazze" nella musica barocca?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Nessuna variazione di volume
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Il passaggio fluido dal piano al forte (crescendo)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Contrasti improvvisi tra gruppi strumentali (tutti vs. soli)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Suonare sempre pi\xF9 forte con l'avanzare della storia"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: "Il Trombone barocco (Sackbut) differisce da quello moderno perch\xE9:"
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Ha una campana pi\xF9 stretta, fondendosi perfettamente con le voci"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Non ha la coulisse (cursore)
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 fatto di legno"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "\xC8 molto pi\xF9 forte e grande"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Cosa significa "Ornamentazione" nell'esecuzione barocca?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Decorare fisicamente gli strumenti con l'oro
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Improvvisare abbellimenti (trilli, passaggi) per esprimere emozioni
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Suonare esattamente ci\xF2 che \xE8 scritto senza modifiche"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Indossare maschere durante l'esecuzione
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Content:
      Type: 0
      Text: Cosa ci insegna l'Orfeo sul potere della musica secondo il documento?
      AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
      Image: {fileID: 0}
    CorrectChoiceDescription: Corretto!
    MaxChoices: 2
    Choices:
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 0
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Che la musica \xE8 solo intrattenimento per la corte"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Che gli strumenti sono pi\xF9 importanti dei cantanti"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: -1
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: Che l'opera deve essere sempre tragica
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
    - IsCorrect: 0
      PointsGiven: 2
      Content:
        Type: 0
        Text: "Che la musica \xE8 forte abbastanza da superare i confini tra i mondi"
        AudioClip: {fileID: 0}
        Image: {fileID: 0}
